\par\par \b \uc2 Kroger\uc2  to Lay Off Workers As Grocer Looks to Cut Costs\b0\par\par\uc2 By Connor Hart \par \uc2 261 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 August 2025\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B7\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Kroger\uc2  said it would conduct "a meaningful number of associate reductions" in a cost-savings push that comes as the company is closing underperforming stores and aiming to boost its profitability.\par \par \uc2 The job cuts will affect the grocer's U.S. administrative teams, Chief Executive \uc2 Ron Sargent\uc2  said in a memo to staff reviewed by The Wall Street Journal.\par \par \uc2 Kroger\uc2  didn't respond to a request on Wednesday to comment. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  earlier reported that the company plans to lay off nearly 1,000 corporate employees.\par \par \uc2 The company employed over 409,000 full- and part-time employees as of Feb. 1, according to the latest head count available in filings with the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Kroger\uc2  plans to reinvest savings stemming from the layoffs into "areas that drive our strategy and benefit our customers directly," such as lowering prices, opening new locations and creating more store-level jobs.\par \par \uc2 "These decisions are never easy, but we know thoughtful, yet difficult, choices are necessary to set our organization up for continued success," Sargent wrote.\par \par \uc2 The layoffs follow \uc2 Kroger\uc2 's failed $20 billion tie-up with \uc2 Albertsons\uc2 , which was blocked by a federal judge in December. The grocery-store operators have since attempted to thwart blame: \uc2 Albertsons\uc2  sued \uc2 Kroger\uc2 , alleging it didn't do enough to secure regulatory approval. \uc2 Kroger\uc2  denied the accusation and countersued \uc2 Albertsons\uc2  for allegedly breaking the merger agreement.\par \par \uc2 More recently, \uc2 Kroger\uc2  has been working to recapture market share it says it lost while trying to buy \uc2 Albertsons\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020250828el8s0000e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
