\par\par \b \uc2 Business News: \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  Sets 2% Corporate Pay Raises\b0\par\par\uc2 By Heather Haddon \par \uc2 255 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 August 2025\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B3\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  is giving corporate employees a 2% raise this year, moving away from merit-based increases at a time when the coffee chain is striving to control costs.\par \par \uc2 All eligible North American corporate support workers and retail managers, along with U.S. manufacturing and distribution workers, will receive the 2% pay bump later this year, the company said in an internal email viewed by The Wall Street Journal.\par \par \uc2 "As we make these significant investments, we need to carefully manage all our other costs," the company said in the Monday message.\par \par \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  is in the midst of a turnaround after six consecutive quarters of declining same-store sales. \uc2 Brian Niccol\uc2 , who took leadership of \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  last year, is investing hundreds of millions of dollars in improving the chain's cafes to try to lure back customers.\par \par \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  this year said it would lay off 1,100 corporate workers and refrain from filling several hundred open positions to streamline functions.\par \par \uc2 In July, the company offered buyouts to corporate workers, and said it would step up its in-office requirements later this year, to four days from three.\par \par \uc2 Remote-working managers who report to the company's support centers will need to relocate to Seattle or Toronto within 12 months, the company said in July.\par \par \uc2 In the Monday message, \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  said its business strategy is working, but it involves significant investments in cafe renovations, technology and barista hours and training. "Together we are making progress," the company said.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020250819el8j0001t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
